  "title": "Downtown Frederick Partnership Receives $100,000 Small Business Accelerator Grant From The Hartford",
  "summary": "FREDERICK, Md., July 28, 2026 Downtown Frederick Partnership has been awarded a $100,000 Small Business Accelerator Grant from The Hartford, in partnership with Main Street America. This grant will help launch Threes Co., a new retail incubator in Downtown Frederick, that will help early-stage retail entrepreneurs test, grow and strengthen their businesses in a supportive, lower-risk environment. Downtown Frederick Partnership will manage the program in partnership with SOUL",
